Every `--json` document, and the `--ready-file` file, uses camelCase keys.

452:- `screen_name` → `screenName` (diff capture, diff compare)
453:- `size_bytes` → `sizeBytes` (diff capture)
454:- `point_dimensions` → `pointDimensions` (diff capture, simulator ensure)
455:- `pixel_dimensions` → `pixelDimensions` (diff capture, simulator ensure)
456:- `display_scale` → `displayScale` (diff capture, simulator ensure)
457:- `device_type` → `deviceType` (simulator ensure)
458:- `pixel_diff_percent` → `pixelDiffPercent` (diff compare)
459:- `perceptual_distance` → `perceptualDistance` (diff compare)
460:- `pixel_threshold` → `pixelThreshold` (diff compare)
461:- `perceptual_threshold` → `perceptualThreshold` (diff compare)
462:- `baseline_path` → `baselinePath` (diff compare)
463:- `capture_path` → `capturePath` (diff compare)
464:- `diff_image_path` → `diffImagePath` (diff compare)
465:- `approved_screens` → `approvedScreens` (diff approve)
466:- `baseline_directory` → `baselineDirectory` (diff approve)
467:- `bundle_id` → `bundleId` (runner start, runner stop; `applicationId` on Android)
